---
title: "update_referral_params (protocol::referral)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: self, referrer_discount_bps, referee_discount_bps, referrer_deposit_usd_threshold
    q_validate --> q_check1: validate referrer_discount_bps
    q_check1 --> q_error1: referrer_discount_bps >= DENOMINATOR
    q_check1 --> q_check2: referrer_discount_bps < DENOMINATOR
    q_error1 --> [*]: abort invalid_params_error()
    q_check2 --> q_error2: referee_discount_bps >= DENOMINATOR
    q_check2 --> q_check3: referee_discount_bps < DENOMINATOR
    q_error2 --> [*]: abort invalid_params_error()
    q_check3 --> q_error3: referrer_deposit_usd_threshold == 0
    q_check3 --> q_update: referrer_deposit_usd_threshold > 0
    q_error3 --> [*]: abort invalid_params_error()
    q_update --> q_update2: self.referrer_discount_bps = referrer_discount_bps
    q_update2 --> q_update3: self.referee_discount_bps = referee_discount_bps
    q_update3 --> [*]: self.referrer_deposit_usd_threshold = referrer_deposit_usd_threshold

    note right of q_validate
        INV-001: Both discount bps must be strictly less than DENOMINATOR (10000)
        INV-002: referrer_deposit_usd_threshold must be strictly greater than 0
        INV-003: Parameters apply to all future operations (not retroactive)
    end note
